# Otacon code ownership — keeps a human on the loop for every change.
# Lines later in the file take precedence over earlier ones (GitHub semantics).
# Reference: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything in the repo.
*                                      @notimeftnoir

# Security-critical paths — always require a review even if branch protection
# is relaxed for trivial doc PRs.
/src/otacon/_validate.py               @notimeftnoir
/src/otacon/resolver.py                @notimeftnoir
/src/otacon/html_report.py             @notimeftnoir
/src/otacon/reporters.py               @notimeftnoir
/.github/workflows/                    @notimeftnoir
/SECURITY.md                           @notimeftnoir
